From 10f5b2f58ab79969196ee61b289db5387b8fc1c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 22:23:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 489/490] soh: reconcile renamed cutscene symbols with new
 develop pin references

The pin bump to upstream develop (ecd889c2) surfaced references to symbols the
rename series renames, in call sites that are new at this pin (the re-cut's
per-definition-file commits could not have seen them):

  * SkipCutscene/QuickBossDeaths.cpp calls func_800C08AC (Play_ReturnToMainCam)
    and func_80064534 (Cutscene_StopManual).
  * SkipCutscene/CutsceneTime.cpp names func_80064824 (CutsceneCmd_Misc) and
    func_80065134 (Cutscene_Command_SetTime) in explanatory comments.

All four names are adopted from zeldaret/oot, so the call sites carry no tag
(per the renaming convention; only guessed names are tagged at call sites).

Also moves the func_800E5E84 (AudioThread_GetFontsForSequence) provenance
comment back above its definition in audio_thread.c: the 3-way replay of the
audio_thread.c rename placed it below the opening brace, which mis-paired
AudioLoad_GetFontsForSequence as a renamed symbol. Comment-only move.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/CutsceneTime.cpp | 4 ++--
 .../TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/QuickBossDeaths.cpp           | 8 ++++----
 soh/src/code/audio_thread.c                               | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/CutsceneTime.cpp b/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/CutsceneTime.cpp
index 2f69c9382..409669151 100644
--- a/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/CutsceneTime.cpp
+++ b/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/CutsceneTime.cpp
@@ -177,7 +177,7 @@ static uint16_t RunScript(const uint32_t* data, uint16_t dayTime, uint16_t timeS
             actorUpdate(dayTime, timeSpeed);
         }
 
-        // func_80064824, only the cases that touch the clock
+        // CutsceneCmd_Misc, only the cases that touch the clock
         for (auto& cmd : script.misc) {
             if (frame < cmd.startFrame || (frame >= cmd.endFrame && cmd.endFrame != cmd.startFrame)) {
                 continue;
@@ -203,7 +203,7 @@ static uint16_t RunScript(const uint32_t* data, uint16_t dayTime, uint16_t timeS
             }
         }
 
-        // func_80065134
+        // Cutscene_Command_SetTime
         for (auto& cmd : script.setTimes) {
             if (frame == cmd.startFrame) {
                 s16 hours = (s16)((cmd.hour * 60.0f) / (360.0f / 0x4000));
diff --git a/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/QuickBossDeaths.cpp b/soh/soh/Enhancements/TimeSavers/SkipCutscene/QuickBossDeaths.cpp
